			"Message": "feat(Output): Expose URI class to SkyBridge search provider\n\nAdd the `URI` class from vscode-uri to the workbench accessor exports so Sky-side bridges can construct real URI instances that the workbench accepts directly.\n\nThe workbench's SearchService deduplicates results by calling `getComparisonKey(uri)` which invokes `uri.with(...)`. Returning raw URIComponents POJOs causes \"uri.with is not a function\" errors. The exposed URI class has the full prototype chain (`.with()`, `.fsPath`, `.toString()`) needed by SkyBridge's search provider result rows.",
